","updated_at":"2026-09-11T16:26:18Z","closed_at":"2026-09-11T16:26:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111305","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111305","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111305.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111305.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-11T16:26:15Z"},"body":"Fixes #106168 \r\nFixes #123214\r\nFixes #123154\r\n\r\nScope: fixes Linux trackpad scrolling on Wayland, and fixes MacOS trackpad scrolling. Windows is unchanged, and mouse scrolling on Linux/MacOS is unchanged.\r\n\r\nOn Linux/Wayland and MacOS, get_delta() returns a value intended to be interpreted as a measurement proportional to a pixel, however previously it was being multiplied by the page size, which makes no sense; the delta is not a proportion of the page size. This has been fixed.\r\n\r\nRelevant docs for MacOS:\r\n    https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appkit/nsevent/scrollingdeltay\r\n    https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appkit/nsevent/scrollingdeltax\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repit